      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saint_Mary-of-the-Woods%2C_Indiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 2015 the college expanded its mission to admit men while preserving its heritage as a women’s college.",
